      "description": "<p>US envoys to visit Moscow and Dublin on Thursday for talks with Vladimir Putin and Volodymyr Zelenskyy respectively</p><p>Russia and Ukraine have agreed to the “largest prisoner exchange” of the war at their first US-brokered talks since February but made little progress towards a broader peace agreement.</p><p>Both sides sent senior delegations to the two-day talks, led by Donald Trump’s envoys Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff, in an effort to find a solution to end the nearly-five-year war.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/11/ukraine-talks-in-abu-dhabi-bring-progress-on-prisoners-but-not-on-peace\">Continue reading...</a>",
